{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"诗篇","commonName":"诗篇","title":"诗篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a6689b3544af059e6077f6a9b93d6c43499c5f9692b20ed9d590c493ca23457","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":32,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["认罪与赦免"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大卫的训诲诗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"过犯得到赦免、罪恶被遮盖的人有福了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不被耶和华算为有罪、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心里没有诡诈的人有福了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我默然不语、拒绝认罪的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就因整日哀叹而身心疲惫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的手昼夜重压我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的精力如水在盛夏枯竭。（细拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"我向你承认自己的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再隐瞒自己的恶。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我说：“我要向耶和华承认我的过犯。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就赦免了我的罪恶。（细拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"因此，趁着还能寻求你的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿所有敬虔的人都当向你祷告；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"洪水泛滥时，必不殃及他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是我的藏身之所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你保护我免遭危难，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用得救的乐歌环绕我。（细拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“我要指教你走正路；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要劝导你，看顾你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要像无知的骡马，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不用嚼环辔头就不驯服。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"恶人必多遭祸患，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的慈爱必环绕信靠祂的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"义人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要靠耶和华欢喜快乐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心地正直的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们都要欢呼。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/32.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/33.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/31.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}